    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「常に一生懸命だと、いつか身体を壊しちゃいますの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「飴ちゃん、あげますの。疲れたときには、甘いものですの～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「あはは、状況がわかりません？　疲れて寝ちゃったんですのよ、あなた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「それよりも、何か着てください。風邪ひいちゃいますのよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「覚えてませんかね、あなた美術部の子たちに脱がされて『そのまんま』寝ちゃったんですの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「うん、ほつれたボタンを縫い直すためにって脱がされたでしょう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「そのへんに、雉子さんたちが新しくこさえたシャツとかありますから……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「それ着て、学ランを羽織ってくださいね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ちょっと、半裸の男の子がそばにいると目の毒ですの～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「んもう、居眠りするならするでちゃんとした格好で寝てくださいね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「うんうん、よく似合ってますの。これで、見慣れた転校生くんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「あはは、雉子さんたちがなぜか張りきってシャツを大量生産しちゃいましたのよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ボタンの縫いつけの特訓とかのためにね、たくさん用意してくれましたのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「シャツだけじゃなくて、いろんな衣装や編みぐるみとかつくってたみたい～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「いま、本物の転校生くんのシャツはかいりがほつれたとこ縫い直してますの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「かいりお裁縫は苦手なので、今日中には終わりそうもないですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「近いうちに、ちゃんと新品どうぜんに仕上げて返しますからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ん？　いや、音楽を聞いてるんじゃないですの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「お裁縫をしてるだけだと暇なのでね、ラジオ番組を聞いてたんですの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「イヤホン、片方だけ貸してあげますの～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「マルちゃん、いろんなラジオ番組を毎日、熱心に聞いてるみたいだから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「でも今は寝ちゃってますから、代わりにね。あとで、内容を教えてあげようかなって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「お裁縫をしながら、ラジオを聞きながら、マルちゃんに膝枕をしながら……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「いろんなこと、同時にできるほど器用じゃありませんけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『しんどいことを、ちょっとずつ』……。しんどくなくなったら、成長したってこと。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「かいりも、マルちゃんを見習っていろいろがんばってみようかなって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「し～、静かにね。マルちゃん、熟睡しちゃってますから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「この子もほんと、誰に似たんだか……。いつも無理して、限界までがんばっちゃいますから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「心配ですの、まだまだ放っておけませんの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「マルちゃんも、かいりに同じことを思ってるかもしれませんけど～♪」"
  },
  {
